{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/pulls/292","id":4821101954,"node_id":"PR_kwDOROLhSM8AAAABH1wtgg","html_url":"https://github.com/yigini/soilfer-lims/pull/292","diff_url":"https://github.com/yigini/soilfer-lims/pull/292.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/yigini/soilfer-lims/pull/292.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/issues/292","number":292,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Runtime OOM] Keep the Kobo duplicate index to identity columns","user":{"login":"yigini","id":32960535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTYwNTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32960535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini","html_url":"https://github.com/yigini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Before: on ae64f169 / bc2557a5, every scheduled Kobo sync loaded `metadata` and `fieldMetadata` for every Sample before matching submissions. Production has 38,773 samples carrying about 409.1M characters in those columns, so the sync exhausted the V8 heap (768 MiB container) about 4 s after fetching 67 ZMB submissions. `lastSyncAt` is written only at the end of a sync, so every restart repeated the same sync 10 s after boot. The result was a crash loop with restartCount above 46 and public health returning 502.\n\nAfter: the sync's duplicate index selects identity and scope columns only (id, originalId, assignedLab, projectCode, status, rejectionReason, latitude, longitude). When a submission matches an existing specimen, that specimen's stored `metadata` and `fieldMetadata` are read once, by id and unchanged, before the hold and provenance checks. Every decision therefore sees exactly the same columns as before. Entries added during the sync already carry their metadata and are not re-read.\n\n**How.**\n- `server/controllers/koboController.js`: the unscoped `sample.findMany` no longer selects the two large columns. A new `hydrateExistingEntry` runs before `legacyHoldState` and the provenance checks; a missing row throws `EXISTING_SAMPLE_NOT_FOUND` instead of guessing.\n- No schema, migration, data, policy or scheduler-cadence change. Background jobs are untouched by this PR.\n\n**Evidence.**\n- New regression `kobo_duplicate_provenance` test 19. Across a real-database replay of an existing primary submission, it asserts that no unscoped findMany selects metadata or fieldMetadata, that exactly one metadata read happens (by the matched id), and that the replay stays idempotent with metadata, fieldMetadata, updatedAt and audit count unchanged. It **fails on ae64f169 and passes here**.\n- Kobo and hold suites: `kobo_duplicate_provenance`, `kobo_explicit_mapping`, `kobo_profile_capture`, `kobo_notification_view_link`, `audit_1_6_sample_holds`, `audit_1_6_hold_install`, `audit_1_6_hold_backfill` and `profile_capture_safety` pass **149/149**.\n- **Owned scale reproduction (scratch copy only).** Built from the test template: 38,773 Samples, 409,055,150 metadata and fieldMetadata characters, run once with 67 submissions under `--max-old-space-size=384`:\n  - ae64f169: `FATAL ERROR: Reached heap limit` 3.0 s in, inside better-sqlite3 `Statement.all` (the findMany);\n  - this head: the sync completes in 460 ms with 73 MB of heap used.\n- The full server suite and the client build will be posted on this PR.\n\nNot in this PR (follow-up candidates): page-by-page fetch accumulation in `koboService.fetchSubmissions`, and recording a sync attempt before fetching so that a failing sync backs off.\n\nRefs #162\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01869phMNBbSrZkcCR7UBe9J\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01869phMNBbSrZkcCR7UBe9J)_","created_at":"2026-10-11T17:54:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T19:30:41Z","closed_at":"2026-10-11T19:30:41Z","merged_at":"2026-10-11T19:30:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"171dd36c5b2dbeea8763520dd18fbdb158ffca05","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/pulls/292/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/pulls/292/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/issues/292/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yigini/soilfer-lims/statuses/cb79d89bfd104466ab7d29a83312dbc7bb48b7a0","head":{"label":"yigini:claude/kobo-sync-bounded","ref":"claude/kobo-sync-bounded","sha":"cb79d89bfd104466ab7d29a83312dbc7bb48b7a0","user":{"login":"yigini","id":32960535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTYwNTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32960535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini","html_url":"https://github.com/yigini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github